12597991e31263f9309a6589dfd63a304349bafc (AGPL-3.0-or-later).
The exact fork revision is pinned by the main repository's Git submodule entry.
The separate github.com/n0madic/go-openvpn/pkg/netstack Go module remains
pinned to the upstream base in go.mod.
Changes: expose raw PUSH options; add opt-in plain outer control framing;
correct control-message TLS record boundaries, transport/key-size options,
and platform peer-info; preserve TLS record boundaries; assemble PUSH
continuations; select TLS-EKM or OpenVPN PRF key derivation; expose session
lifecycle and opt-in fail-closed policy-update handling; add regression tests.
See docs/upstream-patch.md.
